judged) or whose own part miscounts (unwrapped), and the reader's own controls read as files (own); and walks WALK_CONTROL, root included, through claimPages.; extended by seat ws-04 (run g10-work-s147) on trunk 2211bdf plus the cut for wb-a6m9 (the R694 follow-up of landing 682): the combining-mark and escape controls and the R-ESCAPED quiet row Q7; re-measured by seat ws-04 (run g10-work-s153) on trunk bffdf2d, after wb-kv0y's landing 717: THE PLANTED READING's plants carry those controls (every SOURCE_CONTROLS module but the JSX one, every PAGE_CONTROLS page), so plantedModule, plantedPage and A2's and B2's planted witnesses are re-pinned; respun as cut #3 by seat ws-03 (run g10-work-s160) on trunk 379a945 plus the cut for wb-a6m9 refusal #2 (U1-U3, F4): THE FOLD SWEEP's verdict in A3 with its constants (foldClasses, precomposedLetter, foldUnion, foldFloors, foldCarriers); eleven more SOURCE_CONTROLS rows (the page plant's zero-width, full-width, precomposed, noncomposing, spacing, enclosing and joined-mark spellings, and the private-name, no-substitution, template-middle and template-tail escapes), which the module plant carries, so plantedModule and A2's planted witness (plant, count 53 -> 109, extent 12/13 -> 23/24, own) are re-pinned; and Q7's JSX attribute hex probe",
